{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14129","headline":"送吉州阎使君入道二首 二 · 戎昱","name":"送吉州阎使君入道二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"庐陵太守近隳官，霞帔初朝五帝坛。\n风过鬼神延受籙，夜深龙虎卫烧丹。\n冰容入镜纤埃静，玉液添缾漱齿寒。\n莫遣桃花迷客路，千山万水访君难。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戎昱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}